    "text": "The submonoid membership problem for a group G generated by an alphabet A\nasks, for given words x1 , x2 , . . . , xn and a word w over A, whether w belongs to the\nsubmonoid of G generated by the xi . Does there exist a hyperbolic one-relator group\nwith undecidable submonoid membership problem?                      C.-F. Nyberg-Brodda",
